Z||000000||BAM-BAM||04-26-2001||10:28 PM||||  I want to start playing around with fiberglass and was wondering if anyone here could give me some basics. Things like how to make molds, what products to use, different types and weights of cloth, resins, and finish work. I would greatly appriciate any and all advice/help. I want to make some different Fiero related products and if someone could get me started in the right direction i would love it.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||5
